---
layout: page
title: Nunjucks Demo
---

<div class="markdown">
    <h1>🎨 Nunjucks Templating Demo</h1>
    <p>
        This page demonstrates advanced Nunjucks templating features using our MuizenMesh Webring data.
        Nunjucks is much more than basic templating - it's a powerful template engine!
    </p>

    <h2>📊 Basic Data & Statistics</h2>
    
    <details style="margin: 1rem 0; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
        <summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: #495057; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">View Code: Statistics Calculations</summary>
        {% highlight 'njk' %}{% raw %}
<!-- Member count -->
{{ members | length }}

<!-- Members with feeds -->
{% set membersWithFeeds = members | selectattr('feed') | list %}
{{ membersWithFeeds | length }}

<!-- Percentage calculation -->
{% set feedPercentage = ((membersWithFeeds | length) / (members | length) * 100) | round %}
{{ feedPercentage }}%

<!-- Pattern matching -->
{% set southAfricanSites = members | selectattr('url', 'match', '.*\\.co\\.za.*') | list %}
{{ southAfricanSites | length }}
{% endraw %}        {% endhighlight %}
    </details>
    
    <div class="stats-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin: 2rem 0;">
        <div class="stat-card" style="background: #e3f2fd; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
            <h3 style="margin: 0; color: #1976d2;">{{ members | length }}</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; color: #0d47a1;">Total Members</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="stat-card" style="background: #fff3e0; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
            {% set membersWithFeeds = members | selectattr('feed') | list %}
            <h3 style="margin: 0; color: #ff9800;">{{ membersWithFeeds | length }}</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; color: #e65100;">With RSS Feeds</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="stat-card" style="background: #f3e5f5; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
            {% set feedPercentage = ((membersWithFeeds | length) / (members | length) * 100) | round %}
            <h3 style="margin: 0; color: #9c27b0;">{{ feedPercentage }}%</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; color: #6a1b9a;">Feed Coverage</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="stat-card" style="background: #e8f5e8; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
            {% set southAfricanSites = members | selectattr('url', 'match', '.*\\.co\\.za.*') | list %}
            <h3 style="margin: 0; color: #4caf50;">{{ southAfricanSites | length }}</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; color: #2e7d32;">.co.za Sites</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h2>🔄 Loops & Conditionals</h2>
    
    <details style="margin: 1rem 0; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
        <summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: #495057; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">View Code: Conditional Loops</summary>
        {% highlight 'njk' %}{% raw %}
<!-- Loop with conditional -->
{% for member in members %}
    {% if member.feed %}
        <li>{{ member.title }} - Has RSS Feed</li>
    {% else %}
        <li>{{ member.title }} - No RSS Feed</li>
    {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<!-- Alternative: Filter first, then loop -->
{% for member in members | selectattr('feed') %}
    <li>{{ member.title }} - {{ member.feed }}</li>
{% endfor %}
{% endraw %}        {% endhighlight %}
    </details>
    
    <h3>Members by Feed Status</h3>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; margin: 1rem 0;">
        <div>
            <h4 style="color: #4caf50;">✅ Members with RSS Feeds</h4>
            <ul>
                {% for member in members %}
                    {% if member.feed %}
                        <li>
                            <strong>{{ member.title }}</strong>
                            <br><small><a href="{{ member.feed }}" target="_blank">{{ member.feed }}</a></small>
                        </li>
                    {% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div>
            <h4 style="color: #ff9800;">📝 Members without RSS Feeds</h4>
            <ul>
                {% for member in members %}
                    {% if not member.feed %}
                        <li>
                            <strong>{{ member.title }}</strong>
                            <br><small><a href="{{ member.url }}" target="_blank">{{ member.url }}</a></small>
                        </li>
                    {% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h2>🎯 Advanced Filtering & Sorting</h2>
    
    <details style="margin: 1rem 0; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
        <summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: #495057; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">View Code: Sorting and Filtering</summary>
        {% highlight 'njk' %}{% raw %}
<!-- Sort by attribute -->
{% for member in members | sort(attribute='title') %}
    <li>{{ member.title }}</li>
{% endfor %}

<!-- Filter and sort combined -->
{% for member in members | selectattr('feed') | sort(attribute='title') %}
    <li>{{ member.title }} - {{ member.feed }}</li>
{% endfor %}

<!-- Reverse sorting -->
{% for member in members | sort(attribute='title', reverse=true) %}
    <li>{{ member.title }}</li>
{% endfor %}
{% endraw %}        {% endhighlight %}
    </details>
    
    <h3>Members Sorted by Title (A-Z)</h3>
    <ol>
        {% for member in members | sort(attribute='title') %}
            <li>
                <a href="{{ member.url }}" target="_blank">{{ member.title }}</a>
                {% if member.feed %}
                    <span style="color: #4caf50; font-size: 0.8em;">📡 RSS</span>
                {% endif %}
            </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ol>

    <h3>Domain Analysis</h3>
    
    <div style="background: #f5f5f5; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; margin: 1rem 0;">
        <h4>Sites by Domain:</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>muizenmesh.co.za</strong>: 2 sites 🔥</li>
            <li><strong>medialternatives.com</strong>: 1 site</li>
            <li><strong>mecc.org.za</strong>: 1 site</li>
            <li><strong>netbones.co.za</strong>: 1 site</li>
        </ul>
        <p><em>Note: Domain analysis simplified for demo purposes</em></p>
    </div>

    <h2>🧮 Mathematical Operations</h2>
    
    <details style="margin: 1rem 0; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
        <summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: #495057; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">View Code: Mathematical Calculations</summary>
        {% highlight 'njk' %}{% raw %}
<!-- Basic math -->
{{ members | length * 2 }}

<!-- Growth projections -->
{% for month in range(1, 7) %}
    {% set projected = (members | length * (1.2 ** month)) | round %}
    Month {{ month }}: ~{{ projected }} members
{% endfor %}

<!-- Percentage calculations -->
{% set percentage = (value / total * 100) | round(2) %}
{{ percentage }}%

<!-- Complex calculations -->
{% set average = (total_value / count) | round(1) %}
Average: {{ average }}
{% endraw %}        {% endhighlight %}
    </details>
    
    <div style="background: #e3f2fd; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; margin: 1rem 0;">
        <h4>📈 Community Growth Projections</h4>
        <p><strong>Current members:</strong> {{ members | length }}</p>
        <p><strong>If we grow 20% monthly:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            {% for month in range(1, 7) %}
                {% set projected = (members | length * (1.2 ** month)) | round %}
                <li>Month {{ month }}: ~{{ projected }} members</li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>🎨 Dynamic Styling</h2>
    
    <details style="margin: 1rem 0; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
        <summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: #495057; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">View Code: Dynamic Theme Generation</summary>
        {% highlight 'njk' %}
<!-- Define theme array -->
{% raw %}{% set themes = [
    {name: 'ocean', bg: '#e3f2fd', border: '#1976d2'},
    {name: 'sunset', bg: '#fff3e0', border: '#ff9800'}
] %}

<!-- Apply themes cyclically -->
{% for member in members %}
    {% set themeIndex = loop.index0 % 2 %}
    {% set theme = themes[themeIndex] %}
    <div style="background: {{ theme.bg }}; border: 2px solid {{ theme.border }};">
        {{ member.title }}
    </div>
{% endfor %}

<!-- Conditional styling -->
{% if member.feed %}
    <span style="color: green;">Has RSS</span>
{% else %}
    <span style="color: orange;">No RSS</span>
{% endif %}{% endraw %}
        {% endhighlight %}
    </details>
    
    <h3>Member Cards with Dynamic Themes</h3>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin: 2rem 0;">
        {% set themes = [
            {name: 'ocean', bg: '#e3f2fd', border: '#1976d2', text: '#0d47a1'},
            {name: 'sunset', bg: '#fff3e0', border: '#ff9800', text: '#e65100'},
            {name: 'forest', bg: '#e8f5e8', border: '#4caf50', text: '#2e7d32'},
            {name: 'purple', bg: '#f3e5f5', border: '#9c27b0', text: '#6a1b9a'}
        ] %}
        
        {% for member in members %}
            {% set themeIndex = loop.index0 % 4 %}
            {% set theme = themes[themeIndex] %}
            <div style="
                background: {{ theme.bg }};
                border: 2px solid {{ theme.border }};
                border-radius: 8px;
                padding: 1rem;
                color: {{ theme.text }};
            ">
                <h4 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; color: {{ theme.border }};">{{ member.title }}</h4>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.9em;">
                    <a href="{{ member.url }}" target="_blank" style="color: {{ theme.text }};">Visit Site</a>
                    {% if member.feed %}
                        • <a href="{{ member.feed }}" target="_blank" style="color: {{ theme.border }};">RSS Feed</a>
                    {% endif %}
                </p>
                <small style="opacity: 0.7;">Theme: {{ theme.name | title }}</small>
            </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <h2>🔤 String Manipulation</h2>
    
    <details style="margin: 1rem 0; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
        <summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: #495057; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">View Code: String Transformations</summary>
        {% highlight 'njk' %}{% raw %}
<!-- Text case transformations -->
{{ title | upper }}           <!-- UPPERCASE -->
{{ title | lower }}           <!-- lowercase -->
{{ title | title }}           <!-- Title Case -->

<!-- String manipulation -->
{{ title | truncate(15) }}    <!-- Truncated text... -->
{{ title | replace(' ', '-') | lower }}  <!-- URL slug -->

<!-- Advanced string operations -->
{{ url | replace('https://', '') | split('/')[0] }}  <!-- Extract domain -->
{{ text | wordcount }}        <!-- Count words -->
{{ text | reverse }}          <!-- Reverse string -->

<!-- Chaining filters -->
{{ member.title | lower | replace(' ', '-') | replace('&', 'and') }}
{% endraw %}        {% endhighlight %}
    </details>
    
    <div style="background: #f5f5f5; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; margin: 1rem 0;">
        <h4>Text Transformations:</h4>
        <!-- Using direct examples to ensure they always show -->
        {% set exampleTitles = ['MuizenMesh Webring', 'Medialternatives', 'Muizenberg Electricity CC'] %}
        {% for title in exampleTitles %}
            <div style="margin: 1rem 0; padding: 0.5rem; background: white; border-radius: 4px;">
                <p><strong>Original:</strong> {{ title }}</p>
                <p><strong>UPPERCASE:</strong> {{ title | upper }}</p>
                <p><strong>lowercase:</strong> {{ title | lower }}</p>
                <p><strong>Title Case:</strong> {{ title | title }}</p>
                <p><strong>Truncated (15 chars):</strong> {{ title | truncate(15) }}</p>
                <p><strong>Slug:</strong> {{ title | lower | replace(' ', '-') | replace('&', 'and') }}</p>
            </div>
        {% endfor %}
        
        <!-- Show member data examples if available -->
        {% if members | length > 0 %}
            <h5 style="margin-top: 1.5rem; color: #666;">Live Member Data Examples:</h5>
            {% for member in members %}
                {% if loop.index <= 2 %}
                    <div style="margin: 0.5rem 0; padding: 0.5rem; background: #f0f0f0; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em;">
                        <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>{{ member.title }}:</strong> slug = "{{ member.title | lower | replace(' ', '-') | replace('&', 'and') }}"</p>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
        
        <!-- Remove old fallback section -->
        {% if false %}
            <div style="margin: 1rem 0; padding: 0.5rem; background: white; border-radius: 4px;">
                <p><strong>Original:</strong> MuizenMesh Webring</p>
                <p><strong>UPPERCASE:</strong> MUIZENMESH WEBRING</p>
                <p><strong>lowercase:</strong> muizenmesh webring</p>
                <p><strong>Title Case:</strong> Muizenmesh Webring</p>
                <p><strong>Truncated (15 chars):</strong> MuizenMesh Web...</p>
                <p><strong>Slug:</strong> muizenmesh-webring</p>
            </div>
            
            <div style="margin: 1rem 0; padding: 0.5rem; background: white; border-radius: 4px;">
                <p><strong>Original:</strong> Medialternatives</p>
                <p><strong>UPPERCASE:</strong> MEDIALTERNATIVES</p>
                <p><strong>lowercase:</strong> medialternatives</p>
                <p><strong>Title Case:</strong> Medialternatives</p>
                <p><strong>Truncated (15 chars):</strong> Medialternativ...</p>
                <p><strong>Slug:</strong> medialternatives</p>
            </div>
            
            <div style="margin: 1rem 0; padding: 0.5rem; background: white; border-radius: 4px;">
                <p><strong>Original:</strong> Muizenberg Electricity CC</p>
                <p><strong>UPPERCASE:</strong> MUIZENBERG ELECTRICITY CC</p>
                <p><strong>lowercase:</strong> muizenberg electricity cc</p>
                <p><strong>Title Case:</strong> Muizenberg Electricity Cc</p>
                <p><strong>Truncated (15 chars):</strong> Muizenberg Ele...</p>
                <p><strong>Slug:</strong> muizenberg-electricity-cc</p>
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    </div>

    <h2>📅 Conditional Logic</h2>
    
    <details style="margin: 1rem 0; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
        <summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: #495057; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">View Code: Complex Conditionals</summary>
        {% highlight 'njk' %}{% raw %}
<!-- Multi-level conditionals -->
{% if members | length >= 10 %}
    <p>Large Community! {{ members | length }} members</p>
{% elif members | length >= 5 %}
    <p>Growing Community! {{ members | length }} members</p>
{% else %}
    <p>Small but Mighty! {{ members | length }} members</p>
{% endif %}

<!-- Conditional with calculations -->
{% set feedPercentage = ((membersWithFeeds | length) / (members | length) * 100) | round %}
{% if feedPercentage >= 70 %}
    <p>Excellent RSS adoption! {{ feedPercentage }}%</p>
{% elif feedPercentage >= 40 %}
    <p>Good RSS adoption at {{ feedPercentage }}%</p>
{% else %}
    <p>Low RSS adoption ({{ feedPercentage }}%)</p>
{% endif %}

<!-- Inline conditionals -->
<span class="{{ 'has-feed' if member.feed else 'no-feed' }}">
    {{ member.title }}
</span>
{% endraw %}        {% endhighlight %}
    </details>
    
    <div style="background: #fff3e0; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; margin: 1rem 0;">
        <h4>Community Size Assessment:</h4>
        {% if members | length >= 10 %}
            <p style="color: #4caf50; font-weight: bold;">🎉 Large Community! We have {{ members | length }} members - that's fantastic growth!</p>
        {% elif members | length >= 5 %}
            <p style="color: #ff9800; font-weight: bold;">🌱 Growing Community! {{ members | length }} members and counting!</p>
        {% else %}
            <p style="color: #2196f3; font-weight: bold;">🌟 Small but Mighty! {{ members | length }} quality members in our community.</p>
        {% endif %}
        
        <h4>Feed Adoption Rate:</h4>
        {% if feedPercentage >= 70 %}
            <p style="color: #4caf50;">📡 Excellent RSS adoption! {{ feedPercentage }}% of members have feeds.</p>
        {% elif feedPercentage >= 40 %}
            <p style="color: #ff9800;">📊 Good RSS adoption at {{ feedPercentage }}%. Room for improvement!</p>
        {% else %}
            <p style="color: #f44336;">📈 Low RSS adoption ({{ feedPercentage }}%). Let's encourage more feeds!</p>
        {% endif %}
    </div>

    <h2>🔧 Custom Macros</h2>
    
    <details style="margin: 1rem 0; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
        <summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: #495057; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">View Code: Custom Macro Definition</summary>
        {% highlight 'njk' %}{% raw %}
<!-- Define a reusable macro -->
{% macro memberBadge(member, style='default') %}
    {% if style == 'success' %}
        {% set bg = '#e8f5e8' %}
        {% set color = '#4caf50' %}
    {% elif style == 'warning' %}
        {% set bg = '#fff3e0' %}
        {% set color = '#ff9800' %}
    {% else %}
        {% set bg = '#e3f2fd' %}
        {% set color = '#1976d2' %}
    {% endif %}
    
    <span style="background: {{ bg }}; color: {{ color }}; padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 1rem;">
        {{ member.title }}
        {% if member.feed %}📡{% endif %}
    </span>
{% endmacro %}

<!-- Use the macro -->
{{ memberBadge(member, 'success') }}
{{ memberBadge(member, 'warning') }}
{% endraw %}        {% endhighlight %}
    </details>
    
    {% macro memberBadge(member, style='default') %}
        {% if style == 'success' %}
            {% set bg = '#e8f5e8' %}
            {% set color = '#4caf50' %}
        {% elif style == 'warning' %}
            {% set bg = '#fff3e0' %}
            {% set color = '#ff9800' %}
        {% elif style == 'info' %}
            {% set bg = '#f3e5f5' %}
            {% set color = '#9c27b0' %}
        {% else %}
            {% set bg = '#e3f2fd' %}
            {% set color = '#1976d2' %}
        {% endif %}
        
        <span style="
            display: inline-block;
            background: {{ bg }};
            color: {{ color }};
            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0.25rem;
        ">
            {{ member.title }}
            {% if member.feed %}📡{% endif %}
        </span>
    {% endmacro %}
    
    <h4>Member Badges (Using Custom Macro):</h4>
    <div style="margin: 1rem 0;">
        {% for member in members %}
            {% if member.feed %}
                {{ memberBadge(member, 'success') }}
            {% else %}
                {{ memberBadge(member, 'warning') }}
            {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <h2>📋 Summary</h2>
    
    <div style="background: #e8f5e8; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin: 2rem 0;">
        <h4>🎯 What This Demo Shows:</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Data Processing:</strong> Filtering, sorting, and mathematical operations</li>
            <li><strong>Conditional Logic:</strong> Complex if/else statements and comparisons</li>
            <li><strong>Loops & Iteration:</strong> Advanced looping with counters and context</li>
            <li><strong>String Manipulation:</strong> Text transformations and formatting</li>
            <li><strong>Dynamic Styling:</strong> CSS generation based on data</li>
            <li><strong>Custom Macros:</strong> Reusable template components</li>
            <li><strong>Mathematical Operations:</strong> Calculations and projections</li>
            <li><strong>Advanced Filters:</strong> Built-in and custom data filtering</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-style: italic;">
            Nunjucks is much more than basic templating - it's a full-featured template engine 
            that can handle complex data processing, dynamic content generation, and sophisticated 
            presentation logic!
        </p>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 2rem 0;">
        <a href="/" style="
            display: inline-block;
            background: #1976d2;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        ">← Back to Webring</a>
    </div>
</div>